What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?
```java
int v = Fib.f(5);
System.out.println(v + " " + Fib.calls);
```

stimulus.description:
```java
class Fib {
    public static int calls = 0;
    public static int f(int n) {
        calls++;
        if (n <= 1) {
            return n;
        }
        return f(n - 1) + f(n - 2);
    }
}
```

