What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?
```java
int[] v = {30, 8, 16, 18, 14};
System.out.println(Scan.maxFrom(v, 0) + " " + Scan.maxFrom(v, 2) + " " + Scan.maxFrom(v, 4));
```

stimulus.description:
```java
class Scan {
    public static int maxFrom(int[] a, int i) {
        if (i == a.length - 1) {
            return a[i];
        }
        int m = maxFrom(a, i + 1);
        if (a[i] > m) {
            return a[i];
        }
        return m;
    }
}
```

